Invariant: ereferral-inv-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason
Description: "When status is completed, statusReason must use a telemonitoring completed status reason. These status reason codes must not be used for other statuses."
Severity: #error
Expression: "(status != 'completed' or extension.where(url = 'http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/request-statusReason').value.ofType(CodeableConcept).coding.where(system = 'https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/terminology/CodeSystem/be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason' and (code = 'patient-non-compliant' or code = 'patient-deceased' or code = 'patient-requested-stop' or code = 'medical-reasons' or code = 'patient-stabilised' or code = 'patient-transplanted' or code = 'other')).exists()) and (extension.where(url = 'http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/request-statusReason').value.ofType(CodeableConcept).coding.where(system = 'https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/terminology/CodeSystem/be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason').empty() or status = 'completed')"
